The fold of an element of the official right-hand side is the tree element whose carrier is the preimage of that element's carrier under unfolding of tokens. A finite set of tokens from the preimage unfolds into the original carrier, so sum consistency of the image gives tree consistency of the set. A tree token entailed by such a set has its unfolding entailed by the image, and closure of the right-hand-side element puts that unfolding back in the carrier.
